{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2021-11-01 08:31:00', 'title': 'ABBVIE HIGHLIGHTS INNOVATIVE RESEARCH FROM ITS RHEUMATOLOGY PORTFOLIO AT ACR CONVERGENCE 2021', 'text': "NORTH CHICAGO, ILL., NOV. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ABBVIE (NYSE: ABBV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRESENTATION OF NEW DATA ON RINVOQ® (UPADACITINIB), SKYRIZI® (RISANKIZUMAB) AND HUMIRA® (ADALIMUMAB) ACROSS MULTIPLE RHEUMATIC DISEASES AT THE AMERICAN COLLEGE OF RHEUMATOLOGY'S ANNUAL MEETING (ACR CONVERGENCE 2021), TO BE HELD VIRTUALLY NOV. 3-9."}